  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/63bb7d82cb755babaefa1a6c.jpg\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 109px;\" /></p><p>The distance travelled by the person&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;will be equal to the arch length.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>80</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Now the magnitude of displacement can be found using subtraction of vectors. Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>s</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>s</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>135</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>80</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>47</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
